      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我一会儿要用中文参加一个视频通话。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "紧张吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有一点儿，主要怕听不清。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先检查网络和耳机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "网络没问题，耳机也是新的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那把房间安静一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "窗户要关吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "外面有点儿吵，关上会更好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我还写了几个想说的关键词。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好，但别把整句话都写下来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不然我会一直看纸，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对。听不懂的时候就请对方再说一次。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我可以说“请再说一遍”或者“请说慢一点儿”。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "完全可以，很自然。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "通话只有十五分钟，应该不会太累。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "结束以后记一下你没听懂的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好。现在设备都准备好了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc027_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就放松一点儿，正常聊天就好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
